      <widget class="QWidget" name="webContainer" native="true">
       <property name="whatsThis"><string>Drag blocks here to build the activity behaviour. Phases are States; inside each State you stack actions (set the LED, beat, inflate, wait, wait for touch...) and add Transitions that move to another phase after a time, enough touches, or an organ condition.</string></property>
